      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will this have race condition?\n\nIn normal case, the annouce should be start after probing is finished.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/service-t/src/com/android/server/connectivity/mdns/MdnsInterfaceAdvertiser.java;l\u003d137",
